Formula: image `2^v`, fibre `2^(K-v)`.

Python enumeration:

    K=4 v=0: image size=1  (2^v=1)  fibre sizes={16} (2^(K-v)=16)
    K=4 v=1: image size=2  (2^v=2)  fibre sizes={8}  (2^(K-v)=8)
    K=4 v=2: image size=4  (2^v=4)  fibre sizes={4}  (2^(K-v)=4)
